        {"zh": "你将被我的翅膀卷入风暴。", "en": "You will be swept by my wings."},
        {"zh": "我就是你的噩梦。", "en": "I am your nightmare."},
        {"zh": "我的存在就是对自然的警告。", "en": "My presence is a warning to nature."},
        {"zh": "你将为这片森林赎罪。", "en": "You will atone for this forest."},
        {"zh": "森林之魂赋予我猎杀权。", "en": "Forest soul grants me the hunt."}
